  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello,\nSince UI 2.0, the parameter that allowed to enable or disable holding the Quick Menu button to open the Action Menu has disappeared in the controls/bindings settings.\nThe setting is still present in the Regedit (\"VRC_BINDING_STEAMVR_TOUCH_HOLD_QM_h2199240096\" on my side), and I had to change it there... but I would love to have it made more accessible again in the game settings.\nThanks!\nLupsoris",
